export anchor SoftUIStyle:
    number: 173
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Soft UI
    idea: The dashboard is moulded from one pale grey surface, where panels, knobs and buttons are extruded by paired light and dark shadows and wells and grooves are pressed in, yet text keeps full AA contrast and focus is a solid indigo ring.
    base: light
    palette:
        base: #e4e8ef, the single surface everything is moulded from
        highlight: #ffffff, the top-left shadow, never text
        lowlight: #b6bfcc, the bottom-right shadow, never text
        lift: #eef1f6, knob dishes and outlined last-week bars
        ink: #263040, text
        softInk: #4d5868, meta, labels and last-week bar outlines
        indigo: #3346c2, the primary button, fills, the current nav and focus
        green: #1d6b45, On track
        amber: #8a4b00, At risk
        red: #b4232c, Behind and the overdue ring and text
    type:
        One stack, system-ui, Segoe UI Variable, Segoe UI, SF Pro Display,
        Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial. Knob figures are 34px bold, the
        greeting 32px bold at minus 0.01em, project names and headings 16
        to 17px bold, body 14 to 15px, and meta and chips 13px at 600 to
        700.
    layout:
        A raised sidebar holds the brand with a small indigo dot in a
        raised disc and six raised nav pills with line icons, Home pressed
        in and indigo. The main column starts with a pressed pill search,
        a raised indigo New project button, a raised round bell and a
        pressed initials disc with Mara Okafor. A raised greeting panel
        has the greeting and date at left and a pressed red Overdue pill
        at right. Four raised tiles each hold a knob, a pressed ring with
        a raised dish and the figure, over a label, the overdue knob ringed
        in red with a clock. Projects are raised rows with name and meta,
        a pressed groove filled indigo to the percent with a raised round
        thumb, the percent and a pressed status chip. Below sit a raised
        chart panel with a pressed trough of raised pill bars, outlined
        light last week and indigo this week, and a raised activity panel
        with pressed initial discs. Below 1000px the sidebar becomes a
        three by two grid of pills on top, and rows wrap on phones.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16 to 20px between raised items so shadows can breathe, 28px between sections.
    density: Low to medium. Few, large soft objects.
    corners: Very round. 20 to 28px panels, 14px buttons and nav, circles for knobs and icon buttons, pills for fields and chips.
    borders: None. Edges come only from shadow pairs, except a 1.5px soft ink outline on last-week bars.
    shadows: Raised uses 7px 7px 14px lowlight with minus 7px minus 7px 14px highlight, small raised uses 4px, and pressed wells use the same pair inset. The current nav item is pressed in.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.7px for nav. Status icons are solid, a check
        circle for On track, a triangle with a bang for At risk, a rounded
        crossed square for Behind and a clock ring for Overdue, inside
        pressed chips with their word.
    focus: A solid 3px indigo outline offset 3px on every control, never a shadow change alone.
    tone: Plain and neutral, such as Projects, 6 active and Activity.
